Brighten your entrance with the HOMCOM set of 2 artificial cosmos topiary trees. Featuring 13 bundles of mixed-colour flowers, each with 5 branches and 25 flower heads, they create a lush, colourful display in pink, yellow and purple. PE ground stakes allow easy placement in garden soil or planters, making these decorative topiary trees a charming addition to patios, yards and entryways with minimal upkeep.
